      "writtenOn": "2024-09-30T15:48:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That wont\u0027 really work here. Removing pointer lets happens after this, so this would put the access pointer into a let, and then removing pointer lets would remove the let again.\n\nWe\u0027d need to backend to see an access which returns a pointer and not inline it as it is now. Which, could work.",
